{"html":"<div class=\"app\"><div class=\"doc-layout\"><nav class=\"sidebar\"><a class=\"sidebar-wordmark\" href=\"/\">loon</a><div class=\"sidebar-section\"><p class=\"sidebar-section-label\">Learn</p><div><a href=\"/tour\" class=\"sidebar-link\">Tour</a><a href=\"/install\" class=\"sidebar-link\">Installation</a><a href=\"/examples\" class=\"sidebar-link\">By Example</a></div></div><div class=\"sidebar-section\"><p class=\"sidebar-section-label\">Guide</p><div><a class=\"sidebar-link\" href=\"/guide/basics\">Basics</a><a class=\"sidebar-link\" href=\"/guide/functions\">Functions</a><a href=\"/guide/types\" class=\"sidebar-link\">Types</a><a href=\"/guide/collections\" class=\"sidebar-link\">Collections</a><a class=\"sidebar-link\" href=\"/guide/pattern-matching\">Pattern Matching</a><a href=\"/guide/ownership\" class=\"sidebar-link\">Ownership</a><a href=\"/guide/effects\" class=\"sidebar-link\">Effects</a><a href=\"/guide/modules\" class=\"sidebar-link\">Modules</a><a href=\"/guide/macros\" class=\"sidebar-link\">Macros</a><a class=\"sidebar-link\" href=\"/guide/testing\">Testing</a><a href=\"/guide/errors\" class=\"sidebar-link\">Error Handling</a></div></div><div class=\"sidebar-section\"><p class=\"sidebar-section-label\">Reference</p><div><a class=\"sidebar-link\" href=\"/ref/syntax\">Syntax</a><a href=\"/ref/builtins\" class=\"sidebar-link\">Builtins</a><a class=\"sidebar-link\" href=\"/ref/cli\">CLI</a><a href=\"/ref/effects\" class=\"sidebar-link\">Standard Effects</a><a href=\"/ref/lsp\" class=\"sidebar-link\">LSP</a><a class=\"sidebar-link\" href=\"/ref/formatter\">Formatter</a></div></div><div class=\"sidebar-section\"><p class=\"sidebar-section-label\">Concepts</p><div><a href=\"/concepts/invisible-types\" class=\"sidebar-link\">Why Invisible Types</a><a class=\"sidebar-link\" href=\"/concepts/effects\">Understanding Effects</a><a href=\"/concepts/ownership\" class=\"sidebar-link\">Ownership Mental Model</a><a class=\"sidebar-link\" href=\"/concepts/from-rust\">Coming from Rust</a><a class=\"sidebar-link\" href=\"/concepts/from-js\">Coming from JS/TS</a><a class=\"sidebar-link\" href=\"/concepts/from-clojure\">Coming from Clojure</a></div></div><div class=\"sidebar-section\"><p class=\"sidebar-section-label\">Playground</p><div><a href=\"/play\" class=\"sidebar-link sidebar-link-active\">Playground</a></div></div><div class=\"sidebar-section\"><p class=\"sidebar-section-label\">Project</p><div><a href=\"/changelog\" class=\"sidebar-link\">Changelog</a><a href=\"/roadmap\" class=\"sidebar-link\">Roadmap</a><a class=\"sidebar-link\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://github.com/ecto/loon\">GitHub</a></div></div></nav><div class=\"doc-content\"><div class=\"page\"><main style=\"padding: 3rem 0\"><h1 style=\"color: var(--fg); font-size: 2.5rem; font-family: 'IBM Plex Serif', Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif; margin-bottom: 0.5rem\">Playground</h1><p style=\"margin-bottom: 2rem; color: var(--muted)\">Write and run Loon in your browser. This page is itself written in Loon.</p><div class=\"editor-wrapper\"><div class=\"editor-toolbar\"><span class=\"editor-title\">Loon Playground</span><button class=\"cta-button editor-run\">Run</button></div><div class=\"editor-body\"><div class=\"editor-input\"><textarea spellcheck=\"false\" id=\"playground-editor\" class=\"editor-textarea\" placeholder=\"; Write Loon code here...\">; Try some Loon!\n\n[type Shape [Circle f64] [Rect f64 f64] Point]\n\n[fn area [shape]\n  [match shape\n    [Circle r] [* 3.14159 [* r r]]\n    [Rect w h] [* w h]\n    Point 0.0]]\n\n[each [fn [s] [println [str s \" \" [area s]]]]\n  #[[Circle 5.0] [Rect 3.0 4.0] Point]]</textarea></div><div class=\"editor-output-panel\"><div class=\"editor-output-label\">Output</div><pre id=\"playground-output\" class=\"editor-output\">; Click Run to evaluate</pre></div></div></div><div style=\"margin-top: 2rem\"><h3 style=\"color: var(--fg); margin-bottom: 1rem; font-size: 1.3rem; font-family: 'IBM Plex Serif', Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif\">Examples</h3><div style=\"gap: 1rem; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; display: grid\"><div class=\"card\" style=\"padding: 2rem 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--border)\"><div><h4 style=\"color: var(--fg); margin-bottom: 0.5rem; font-family: 'IBM Plex Serif', Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif\">Hello World</h4><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\"><pre class=\"code-block\"><code id=\"lc-25--1\" class=\"language-loon\">[println \"Hello, world!\"]</code></pre></div></div></div><div class=\"card\" style=\"padding: 2rem 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--border)\"><div><h4 style=\"font-family: 'IBM Plex Serif', Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif; color: var(--fg); margin-bottom: 0.5rem\">Fibonacci</h4><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\"><pre class=\"code-block\"><code id=\"lc-96-11\" class=\"language-loon\">[fn fib [n]\n  [match n\n    0 0  1 1\n    _ [+ [fib [- n 1]]\n            [fib [- n 2]]]]]\n[fib 10]</code></pre></div></div></div><div class=\"card\" style=\"padding: 2rem 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--border)\"><div><h4 style=\"font-family: 'IBM Plex Serif', Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; color: var(--fg)\">Effects</h4><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\"><pre class=\"code-block\"><code class=\"language-loon\" id=\"lc-106-11\">[effect Ask\n  [fn question [q]]]\n\n[handle\n  [Ask.question \"name?\"]\n  [Ask.question q]\n    [resume \"Loon\"]]</code></pre></div></div></div><div class=\"card\" style=\"padding: 2rem 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--border)\"><div><h4 style=\"font-family: 'IBM Plex Serif', Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; color: var(--fg)\">Pipelines</h4><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\"><pre class=\"code-block\"><code class=\"language-loon\" id=\"lc-90-19\">[pipe [range 1 100]\n  [filter [fn [n] [= 0 [% n 3]]]]\n  [map [fn [n] [* n n]]]\n  [take 5]]</code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></main></div><footer class=\"footer\" style=\"margin-top: 2rem; padding: 3rem 0; align-items: center; display: flex; gap: 1.5rem\"><span style=\"font-size: 0.78rem; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: var(--muted); font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', ui-monospace, 'SFMono-Regular', monospace\">loon</span><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://github.com/ecto/loon\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0.05em; font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--muted); text-decoration: none; font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', ui-monospace, 'SFMono-Regular', monospace\">GitHub</a><a href=\"https://github.com/ecto/loon/blob/main/LICENSE\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0.05em; font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--muted); text-decoration: none; font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', ui-monospace, 'SFMono-Regular', monospace\">MIT License</a></footer></div></div></div>","title":null}
